This closure holds live credential configuration in plaintext.

File:  infra-profile.yaml
Keys:  api-source.attributes -> credential_env (names the environment
       variable the connector runtime reads for the live bearer token;
       no live token value is stored in this file)
Rotate: replace the `credential_env` value and rebuild the data product
        if the deployment's token environment variable name changes.

Do not commit or hand-zip this directory with credential configuration
intact, or reuse it as a template for a different source without
clearing it first. To share the product, use the supervisor's
export_data_product tool, which strips credentials fail-closed.
